/-!
# Appendix A: concrete combinatorial claims behind the bad-face filtration

Formalized by Claude Sonnet 5.5.  Paper:.

The library proves Lemma A.1 and the restricted acyclicity by its own route (`Exports/AppendixALink`, `Exports/AppendixAAcyclicity`, the original library); this file exports the *intermediate* claims of the
paper's proof that are concrete combinatorics, with the paper's objects:

| paper | export |
|---|---|
| two bad vertices are never adjacent; the link of a bad vertex is a bi-infinite path of good vertices | `RankTwo.bad_vertices_not_adjacent`, `RankTwo.bad_vertex_link_is_path` (graph isomorphism `linkPathIso` with `pathGraphZ`) |
| the good link of a bad triangle is the discrete set `{(w + rb + sc)^±}` | `BadFaces.bad_triangle_exists_core`, `BadFaces.bad_triangle_good_link` |
| the good link of a bad edge is the square-grid graph, connected, `H₁` generated by unit squares | `BadFaces.bad_edge_good_link`, `badEdgeLinkIso`, `gridAdjacent_iff_vector_diff`, `bad_edge_link_connected`, `bad_edge_link_H1_generated_by_squares`, `unit_square_is_cycle` |
| the five good vectors `A,B,C,D,W` and the square cap `eq:square-cap` filling each tetrahedral generator | `Differentials.five_good_vectors`, `five_vertices_good`, `square_cap_fills`, `tetraSphere_square`, `tetraSpheres_filled` |
| the two fillings of a unit square and their difference `-∂[A,B,C,D]` | `Differentials.second_differential_fillings`, `unitSquare_eq_squareLoop` |
| the cycle `Z₀` (`eq:triangle-cycle`), `∂Z₀ = 0`, leading component `[w'] - [w]` | `Differentials.third_differential_cycle`, `third_differential_vectors`, `third_differential_good_bad`, `third_differential_leading` |

NOT formalized: the spectral sequence `eq:bad-filtration` itself (its `E¹`-page, differentials, convergence) and the statements about "incoming differentials"; only the chain-level facts used to show that
the differentials vanish are exported.  The prism cap `eq:prism-cap` is covered by `Statements.AppendixALink` (`AugmentedPrismCaps`).  Source of the proofs: the library's the original library modules
(`RankTwoGoodComplex`, `RankTwoVertexLinks`, `BadEdgeLinkGrid/Chains`, `BadTriangleLink`, `AugmentedSquareCaps`, `AugmentedEightTermCycle`, `BadVertexSquareCaps`), which are not on the original route.
-/

